## How the registration form works\
\
The form posts to Google Forms via a hidden iframe and redirects to\
`thankyou.html` on successful submission. The Google Forms action URL\
is in the `<form action="...">` attribute on each page.\
\
**Do not change** the `name="entry.XXXXXXXX"` attributes on form inputs \'97\
these are Google Forms field IDs and will break data collection if altered.\
